Do not modify unrelated module metadata merely because the module failed.
Evidence should drive the correction.
When a protocol fails, identify resolution.
Identify connection.
Identify handshake.
Identify network identity.
Identify version.
Identify capability.
Identify authentication.
Identify request validation.
Identify operation acceptance.
Identify persistence.
Identify response.
