When instrumenting a system, start with boundaries.
Instrument startup.
Instrument configuration.
Instrument dependencies.
Instrument authoritative operations.
Instrument persistence.
Instrument shutdown.
When creating a log event, ask what happened.
Ask which component observed it.
Ask which operation it affected.
Ask what evidence supports the result.
