When investigating, preserve uncertainty until resolved.
A good observability system makes it easier to say:
This happened.
This component observed it.
This operation failed.
This module was rejected at this stage.
This peer connected but did not qualify.
This recovery action was taken.
This verification succeeded.
This evidence supports the conclusion.
