A binary can compile.
A binary can link.
The binary can still fail to start because a runtime dependency is missing.
Module discovery can succeed.
Library loading can fail.
Library loading can succeed.
Symbol resolution can succeed.
Module qualification can fail.
Qualification can succeed.
These are separate stages.
Report the actual failed stage.
Do not collapse every module-loading failure into "module missing."
