Write-ahead logging is one technique used by storage systems.
Copy-on-write is another technique.
Atomic rename is useful for file replacement on supporting filesystems.
Database transactions provide another mechanism.
Choose according to persistence layer.
Algorithm design should consider failure at every externally visible step.
