A reliable configuration system has deterministic precedence.
A reliable configuration system distinguishes absent from invalid.
A reliable configuration system validates cross-field relationships.
A reliable configuration system knows source authority.
A reliable configuration system protects secrets.
A reliable configuration system exposes effective non-secret state for diagnosis.
A reliable configuration system defines reload semantics.
