A reliable configuration system separates configuration from state.
A reliable configuration system separates configuration from policy.
A reliable configuration system does not guess.
Do not confuse configuration with authority.
Do not confuse configuration with identity.
Do not confuse configuration with secrets.
Do not confuse configuration with data.
