Configuration selects.
Code implements.
State records.
Rules constrain.
Policy governs where applicable.
Evidence establishes.
Keep those boundaries clear.
Where did each important value come from?
Why was that value selected?
Is it valid?
Who was permitted to set it?
What happens if it changes?
