The operation can complete immediately before cancellation is processed.
The protocol should define resulting state.
Cancellation acknowledgment can mean cancellation was accepted.
It does not necessarily mean no effect occurred before cancellation.
Distributed cancellation has uncertainty like other remote operations.
A protocol can support transactions.
