Protocol documentation should identify version.
Protocol documentation should identify state transitions.
Protocol documentation should identify limits.
Protocol documentation should identify error behavior.
Protocol documentation should identify security requirements.
Protocol documentation should identify compatibility rules.
Protocol documentation should identify persistent state requirements.
Protocol documentation should identify authority boundaries.
A protocol diagram can illustrate flow.
