When extending a protocol, preserve old meaning.
Add explicit new meaning.
Version when required.
Negotiate when required.
Reject unsupported behavior deterministically.
Test old-to-new communication.
Test new-to-old communication.
Test malformed extension data.
Test missing extension data.
Test participants without the capability.
