When protocol behavior affects multiple platforms, test multiple platforms.
Serialize explicitly.
Use fixed semantics.
Avoid platform-dependent assumptions.
Avoid unspecified integer widths.
Avoid host byte order.
Avoid local path conventions.
Avoid local timezone interpretation.
Avoid uncontrolled locale behavior.
