A discovered module should not automatically execute.
A loaded module should not automatically receive unrestricted authority.
A module contract should define required entry points.
A module contract should define supported versions.
A module contract should define ownership.
A module contract should define lifecycle.
A module contract should define failure behavior.
A module contract should define capabilities where applicable.
The host owns the host architecture.
A core component contains behavior considered foundational to the system architecture.
