Use platform or database mechanisms where available.
Initialization should be idempotent.
Repeated initialization should not duplicate permanent state.
Genesis or root state should be uniquely defined where architecture uses it.
Do not regenerate authoritative root state merely because loading failed.
Persistent identifiers should remain stable.
