Atomic storage operations can reduce selected TOCTOU races.
Filesystem security often requires operating on already-open handles rather than re-resolving untrusted paths.
Storage parsers should be deterministic where deterministic behavior is required.
Given the same valid bytes and same format version, parsing should produce the same authoritative interpretation across supported platforms.
Do not depend on native integer width.
Do not depend on native structure padding.
Do not depend on unspecified field ordering.
Do not depend on platform newline conversion for protocol-significant content.
Define representation.
