Do not normalize an externally signed representation before verifying it unless the signature specification requires normalization.
Changing representation changes signed bytes.
Encoding transformations can invalidate signatures.
Encoding transformations can invalidate hashes.
Encoding transformations can invalidate content-addressed identifiers.
