Do not confuse normalization with case folding.
Do not confuse transliteration with encoding.
Do not confuse character encoding with collation.
Do not confuse decoded data with trusted data.
Do not confuse valid UTF-8 with semantically valid text.
Do not confuse visual similarity with identity.
